            "target_entity_instance": "Atlantic",
            "target_entity_type": "No_Country_Region",
            "paragraph": "Regionally, however, the MCO1x experiment has a drier central America and North Atlantic, which could be due to the open central American seaway, allowing for mixing of Atlantic and Pacific Ocean waters, and therefore, slowing AMOC (Maier-Reimer et al., 1990; Lunt et al., 2007).",
